# CI Pipeline

## Structure

- `pr-ci.yml` — triggers on PRs targeting `main` or `master`, runs lint → type check → test

There are no image-publish workflows: the NAS builds the app image from source via
`docker compose up --build` (see `docs/DEPLOYMENT_PORTAINER.md`). Don't add one —
this is a single-deployment-target project (NAS only).

Both `main` and `master` are **protected branches**. Branch protection requires the `ci` check from `pr-ci.yml` to pass before a PR can be merged.

## CI job (pr-ci.yml)

```yaml
- name: Lint (ruff)
  run: ruff check .

- name: Type check (mypy)
  run: mypy app/

- name: Test (pytest)
  run: pytest
```

All three steps must pass. Do not remove or skip any of them.

## What not to do

- Do **not** bypass branch protection or merge without a passing `ci` check.
- Do **not** add image-publish workflows (deploy/build-pi/etc.) — the NAS builds from
  source; there is no second deployment target to publish images for.
